{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米在陶匠的家"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话临到耶利米说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你起来，下到窑匠的家里去，我在那里要使你听我的话。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我就下到窑匠的家里去，正遇他转轮做器皿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["窑匠用泥做的器皿，在他手中做坏了，他又用这泥另做别的器皿；窑匠看怎样好，就怎样做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华的话就临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「耶和华说：以色列家啊，我待你们，岂不能照这窑匠弄泥吗？以色列家啊，泥在窑匠的手中怎样，你们在我的手中也怎样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我何时论到一邦或一国说，要拔出、拆毁、毁坏；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我所说的那一邦，若是转意离开他们的恶，我就必后悔，不将我想要施行的灾祸降与他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我何时论到一邦或一国说，要建立、栽植；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们若行我眼中看为恶的事，不听从我的话，我就必后悔，不将我所说的福气赐给他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["现在你要对犹大人和耶路撒冷的居民说：『耶和华如此说：我造出灾祸攻击你们，定意刑罚你们。你们各人当回头离开所行的恶道，改正你们的行动作为。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「他们却说：『这是枉然。我们要照自己的计谋去行。』各人随自己顽梗的恶心做事。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["百姓忘记耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以，耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们且往各国访问，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有谁听见这样的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列民","poem":1},{"noteId":22},{"text":"行了一件极可憎恶的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的雪从田野的磐石上岂能断绝呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从远处流下的凉水岂能干涸呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓竟忘记我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向假神烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们在所行的路上，在古道上绊跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们行没有修筑的斜路，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们的地令人惊骇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"常常嗤笑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡经过这地的必惊骇摇头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在仇敌面前分散他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像用东风吹散一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭难的日子，我必以背向他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不以面向他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["谋害耶利米"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他们就说：「来吧！我们可以设计谋害耶利米；因为我们有祭司讲律法，智慧人设谋略，先知说预言，都不能断绝。来吧！我们可以用舌头击打他，不要理会他的一切话。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你理会我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且听那些与我争竞之人的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂可以恶报善呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们竟挖坑要害我的性命！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你记念我怎样站在你面前为他们代求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使你的忿怒向他们转消。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，愿你将他们的儿女交与饥荒和刀剑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们的妻无子，且作寡妇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又愿他们的男人被死亡所灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的少年人在阵上被刀击杀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使敌军忽然临到他们的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿人听见哀声从他们的屋内发出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们挖坑要捉拿我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暗设网罗要绊我的脚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，他们要杀我的那一切计谋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你都知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要赦免他们的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要从你面前涂抹他们的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要叫他们在你面前跌倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿你发怒的时候罚办他们。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":22,"caller":"-","text":"原文是处女","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}